uvYCqgszHCix8rDYm8l2Iu.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-07-07\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Highs & Lows\",\"overview\":\"The Teen Moms are back, and Mia returns to the cast. Sassi is heartbroken that Zenaya prefers staying with her dad. Mia tries to build bridges with Manley. Lockdown leaves Amber feeling depressed. Chloe resists Jordan's suggestion of Baby no. 2\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j3m36dLIR4RSw1AguYwYJA0J3Qz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-07\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Bust Ups and Breakthroughs\",\"overview\":\"Sassi blows up at being mugged off by Darren, Jordan makes a life changing decision, Amber and Ste clash and Mia gets big news about her Dads health.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k9KxYFKWeWaZFAEFTACnRKRI8VH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Secrets & Surprises\",\"overview\":\"Jordan has to hide a big secret from Chloe, Ste drops a bombshell. Mia faces some new parenting hurdles. Sassi piles the pressure on Darren, and he snaps.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hOYsMy9wuXjPNaXoqaJ2QkIINt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Bling, Rings and New Beginnings\",\"overview\":\"Mia moves house but things go horribly wrong. Jordan splashes out on the ring, a desperate Sassi needs help with Zenayas learning. Ste tries to put the pieces together from his childhood.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g5392EwI4sUxDDluYooLyJmCGvy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-07-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Exposed\",\"overview\":\"Chloe lands a big lingerie campaign but shes terrified to take her clothes off. Its a big day for Ste as he goes for his ADHD assessment. Mia struggles to juggle mum life and work.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iN0Qx7PcHz96nZe8S0KZ2Ze5Hxo.jpg\",\"ratin